/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53133&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:55279:1","headword":"명료하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"분명하고 확실하다.","englishExpression":"clear; lucid; certain","englishDescription":"Being clear and certain.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55279&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:55348:1","headword":"명시적","partOfSpeech":"determiner","partOfSpeechKo":"관형사","definitionKo":"내용이나 뜻을 분명하게 드러내 보이는.","englishExpression":"explicit; clear","englishDescription":"Being clear in a statement or an expression.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55348&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:55451:1","headword":"명징하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"아주 분명하다.","englishExpression":"clear; explicit","englishDescription":"Very clear.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55451&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:55458:1","headword":"명쾌하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"말이나 글이 앞뒤가 들어맞고 체계가 있어 시원스럽다.","englishExpression":"clear; explicit; lucid","englishDescription":"A speech or writing's being straightforward due to its coherent and organized structure.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55458&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:60323:2","headword":"깨끗하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"빛깔 등이 흐리지 않고 맑다.","englishExpression":"clear; clean","englishDescription":"A color, etc. being clear, not dull.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60323&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:60803:1","headword":"빠끔하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"작은 구멍이나 틈 등이 깊고 또렷하게 나 있다.","englishExpression":"deep; clear","englishDescription":"A small hole, crack, etc., being deep and noticeable.","s